# Validation checklist

**Canonical checklist:** [`docs/validation-checklist.md`](../docs/validation-checklist.md)

## When to use

- **Validator agent:** Audit every **applicable** checklist section before issuing `validation-report.md`. Record results in the report’s **Checklist audit** section (item ID, status, evidence).
- **Planner:** Pull relevant checklist rows into `plan.md` → **Validation steps**; map to AC IDs.
- **Human PR review:** Use the same IDs when reviewing changes that touch offline, auth, cloud, AI, schema, or a11y boundaries.

## Verdict interaction

- Any applicable **❌** on merge-ready gates (**MG-***) or on a checklist item explicitly required by `plan.md` / an Accepted ADR → default **FAIL** (or **PASS_WITH_NOTES** only with documented human/Orchestrator acceptance).
- Mark sections **N/A** with a one-line reason when the change does not touch that domain.

